            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/01.NPR.0000421429.62425.33</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Asthma, a chronic inflammatory lung disease, is one of the most common and costly diseases in the United States, affecting people of all ages and all ethnic groups. While there is no cure for asthma, optimal disease control and quality of life are possible with proper management and treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
